      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's perfect, exactly the tone we're looking for there. \n\nNow, we also want to make sure we're reaching all segments of our market effectively. We've noticed that for some of our customers, especially in more urban or inner-city areas, that super formal tone can actually feel a bit cold or even out of touch. It doesn't always build that \"instant connection.\"\n\nCould you draft a second version? Something a bit more \"casual\" and \"urban-friendly\" that might resonate better with those specific demographics? Just something that feels more relaxed and relatable.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
