      "content": "Thanks. I see what you mean with the \"urban\" vibe, it's definitely more relaxed. \n\nI'm just wondering though, if we're going to roll this out to different territories, how do we make sure we're really hitting the mark for those specific communities? Like, when you're writing something \"urban-friendly,\" are there certain linguistic patterns or slang terms you'd suggest we include to make it feel even more authentic to those specific neighborhoods? I want to make sure the bot sounds like it actually belongs in that environment rather than just sounding like a corporate person trying too hard.",
